<view class="page">
  <view class="head"><view class="kicker">COMBINATION VACCINE</view><view class="title">联苗接种登记</view><view class="desc">主人预登记后，实际品牌、批号与库存由医护现场确认</view></view>

  <view class="section"><view class="section-title"><text>01</text>主人与宠物</view><view class="label">主人手机号</view><view class="phone-row"><input type="number" maxlength="11" value="{{phone}}" bindinput="onPhoneInput" placeholder="请输入医院登记手机号"/><button bindtap="lookupCustomer" loading="{{lookupLoading}}">查询档案</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{lookupDone && customer}}" class="found">找到主人：{{customer.name || '未填写姓名'}} · {{pets.length}}只宠物</view>
    <radio-group wx:if="{{pets.length}}" bindchange="selectPet" class="pet-list"><label wx:for="{{pets}}" wx:key="id" class="pet"><radio value="{{item.id}}" checked="{{selectedPetId==item.id}}"/>{{item.name}}<text>{{item.species=='cat'?'猫':'犬'}} · {{item.breed || '未填品种'}}</text></label></radio-group>
    <button wx:if="{{lookupDone}}" class="outline" bindtap="chooseNewPet">＋ 这次为新宠物建档</button>
    <view wx:if="{{useNewPet}}" class="new-pet"><view class="label">主人姓名</view><input data-field="ownerName" value="{{ownerName}}" bindinput="fieldInput" placeholder="主人姓名"/><view class="label">宠物姓名</view><input data-field="petName" value="{{petName}}" bindinput="fieldInput" placeholder="宠物姓名"/><view class="two"><view><view class="label">种类</view><radio-group bindchange="chooseSpecies"><label><radio value="cat" checked="{{petSpecies=='cat'}}"/>猫</label><label><radio value="dog" checked="{{petSpecies=='dog'}}"/>犬</label></radio-group></view><view><view class="label">性别</view><radio-group bindchange="chooseGender"><label><radio value="male"/>公</label><label><radio value="female"/>母</label><label><radio value="unknown" checked="{{petGender=='unknown'}}"/>未知</label></radio-group></view></view><view class="label">品种</view><input data-field="petBreed" value="{{petBreed}}" bindinput="fieldInput" placeholder="选填"/><view class="label">出生日期 / 年龄</view><input data-field="petBirthday" value="{{petBirthday}}" bindinput="fieldInput" placeholder="选填，例如 2025-03"/></view>
  </view>

  <view class="section"><view class="section-title"><text>02</text>接种计划</view><view class="label">接种门店</view><picker mode="selector" range="{{storeOptions}}" value="{{storeIndex}}" bindchange="chooseStore"><view class="picker {{storeIndex?'':'placeholder'}}">{{storeOptions[storeIndex]}}</view></picker><view class="label">免疫阶段</view><picker mode="selector" range="{{stageOptions}}" value="{{stageIndex}}" bindchange="chooseStage"><view class="picker {{stageIndex?'':'placeholder'}}">{{stageOptions[stageIndex]}}</view></picker><view class="label">计划接种日期</view><picker mode="date" value="{{requestedDate}}" bindchange="chooseDate"><view class="picker">{{requestedDate}}</view></picker></view>

  <view class="section"><view class="section-title"><text>03</text>接种前问卷</view><view class="question-tip">请严格按题目中的“近7天 / 近15天”回答。有异常只会提醒医护判断，不会由系统自动拒绝。</view><view wx:for="{{questions}}" wx:key="key" class="question {{item.value=='yes'?'risk':''}}"><view class="question-label">{{index+1}}. {{item.label}}</view><radio-group data-index="{{index}}" bindchange="answerQuestion"><label><radio value="no" checked="{{item.value=='no'}}"/>否</label><label><radio value="yes" checked="{{item.value=='yes'}}"/>是</label></radio-group><textarea wx:if="{{item.value=='yes'}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="questionDetail" value="{{item.detail}}" placeholder="请简要说明时间、症状或治疗情况"/></view></view>

  <view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button class="submit" bindtap="submit" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}">确认资料并签署接种同意书</button><view class="foot">提交后需由医护现场检查并点击允许接种，系统不会自动判断是否适合接种。</view>
</view>
